"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang=\"en\">
<head>
    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">
    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">
    <title>AETHER ENGINE // Hyper-Realistic 3D Survival Sandbox</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS for sleek UI -->
    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome for crisp iconography -->
    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter @COMMENT_BODY@ JetBrains Mono -->
    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700@COMMENT_BODY@family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700@COMMENT_BODY@display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">

    <style>
        body, html {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #050505;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }
        .mono {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        /* Custom Range Slider Styling */
        input[type=range] {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            background: transparent;
        }
        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            height: 16px;
            width: 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #38bdf8;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: -6px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8);
            transition: transform 0.1s ease;
        }
        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }
        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        /* Glassmorphism panels */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.78);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        }
        /* Custom Scrollbar for Settings */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.6);
        }
    </style>

    <!-- Import Map for Three.js @COMMENT_BODY@ Post-Processing -->
    <script type=\"importmap\">
        {
            \"imports\": {
                \"three\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\",
                \"three/addons/\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/examples/jsm/\"
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class=\"text-slate-100\">

    <!-- WebGL Container -->
    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0\"></div>

    <!-- Center Crosshair -->
    <div id=\"crosshair\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300\">
        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)]\"></div>
        <div id=\"interact-prompt\" class=\"absolute mt-12 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 text-xs font-medium tracking-wider text-sky-300 hidden\">
            [E] INTERACT / GRAB
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top-Left Telemetry @COMMENT_BODY@ Performance HUD -->
    <div class=\"fixed top-4 left-4 z-20 pointer-events-none flex flex-col gap-2\">
        <div class=\"glass-panel px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl flex i

---
This is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.

Screenshots for your own checks: save small JPEGs (a .jpg path, viewport at most 1280px wide) and read only the latest one; older images are dropped from context. Read a full-size PNG only when fine detail matters.
"

